      "review_summary": "The PR adds Slack outbound facade presentation capability/renderPresentation forwarding, changes shared payload receipt classification, and adds Slack plus outbound-bridge tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +36, Tests +122. Total +158 across 4 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level. Current main lacks the Slack facade renderer/capability bridge, and the PR still has a source-reproducible receipt edge because core strips presentation after rendering and the classifier does not inspect rendered Slack channelData.",
