      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(slack): bridge presentation capabilities and renderPresentation through channel outbound facade",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nSlack channel outbound facade does not bridge `renderPresentation` to the core delivery pipeline. Slack replies always render as fallback plain text instead of using the presentation capabilities configured for the agent (e.g., rich formatting, interactive cards).\n\nCloses #95440\n\n## Fix\n\nBridge `renderPresentation` through the Slack channel outbound facade so Slack replies respect the agent presentation configuration. Also fix the shared receipt classifier to handle title-only presentations (check `presentation.title` in addition to `presentation.blocks`).\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Real Slack proof — presentation delivers `\"kind\": \"card\"` receipt\n\n```\n$ pnpm openclaw message send --channel slack \\\n  --target \"channel:随机\" \\\n  --message \"95463 Proof — Block Kit\" \\\n  --presentation '{\"title\":\"PR Proof\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Block Kit ✅\"},{\"type\":\"divider\"}]}' \\\n  --json\n\n{\n  \"messageId\": \"1782990777.502789\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"receipt\": {\n        \"parts\": [\n          {\n            \"kind\": \"card\",\n            \"raw\": {\n              \"channel\": \"slack\",\n              \"messageId\": \"1782990777.502789\",\n              \"channelId\": \"C0BEKN062GM\"\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Test suite (12 outbound-bridge + 46 Slack = 58 tests)\n\n```\npnpm test src/channels/message/outbound-bridge.test.ts\n  createChannelMessageAdapterFromOutbound\n    ✓ infers receipt kind as card when both text and presentation are present (#95440)\n    ✓ returns card kind for title-only presentation without blocks\n    ✓ falls through to text for empty interactive without presentation\n    ✓ returns text kind for payloads with only text and no presentation\n  12 tests passed (1 file)\n\npnpm test extensions/slack/src/channel.test.ts\n  slackChannelOutbound presentation\n    ✓ exposes renderPresentation on the channel outbound adapter\n    ✓ exposes presentationCapabilities on the channel outbound adapter\n    ✓ delegates renderPresentation to slackOutbound and returns presentationBlocks\n  46 tests passed (1 file)\n```\n\n## Change Type\n- [x] Bug fix\n## Scope\n- [x] Slack channel (outbound facade)\n## Security Impact\n- New permissions? No · Secrets changed? No · New network calls? No\n",
